//@check
//= true 1 2 3.1 3.2
    
// Conversion ToString is duck-typed.
// When trying to convert an expression to string, the binder
// searches for "ToString" methods that fit the signature.

// Strings are accepted
Print("{ "" } ");

// All primitive types have a ToString
Print("{true} ");
Print("{1i32} ");
Print("{2i64} ");
Print("{3.1f32} ");
Print("{3.2f64} ");